{"seq":2,"slug":"plot-traceability-batch-lineage","title":"地块溯源与批次谱系建模：从原料到成品的供应链图谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eudr-deforestation-free-supply-chain-due-diligence/parcel-geolocation-traceability-data/plot-traceability-batch-lineage","wordCount":2694,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"地块溯源与批次谱系建模-从原料到成品的供应链图谱\">地块溯源与批次谱系建模：从原料到成品的供应链图谱</h1><p>一块印尼的小农棕榈园，其果串被压榨成毛油，与另外四百座小农的毛油在收储站的油罐里混合，再精炼、分提、装船、出口到鹿特丹，最终变成某超市自有品牌的饼干。EUDR 的合规义务落在征收那一刻的&quot;地块&quot;上，但需要被证明的却是两年后货架上的那件商品。中间这段断裂——地块身份如何穿过混合、转化与转移而不丢失——就是批次谱系建模要解决的问题。它承接 <a href=\"parcel-geolocation-data-model\">地块地理定位数据模型</a> 中确定的几何与坐标契约（几何类型、坐标系、精度），把&quot;一堆坐标&quot;升级为&quot;一张可回溯到坐标的供应链有向图&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-谱系图的五类节点与四类边\">核心概念：谱系图的五类节点与四类边</h2><p>把供应链写成图，第一步是决定什么是节点。把&quot;公司&quot;或&quot;国家&quot;当节点会在混合环节彻底失效，因为一个油罐里的油可能同时来自几十个地块。正确的做法是按<strong>物料身份的可分辨性</strong>切分节点，得到五类实体：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>关键字段</th>\n<th>身份何时失效</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Plot（地块）</td>\n<td>地理定位的最小单元</td>\n<td>plot_id、GeoJSON 几何、面积</td>\n<td>永不失效（是图的锚）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Batch / Lot（批次）</td>\n<td>一次可分辨的物料集合</td>\n<td>batch_id、商品、数量、单位、生产时间区间</td>\n<td>混合后失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transformation（转化事件）</td>\n<td>投入→产出的加工步骤</td>\n<td>工艺类型、投入清单、产出清单、收率</td>\n<td>事件本身可追溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipment（运输/移交）</td>\n<td>批次在主体间的所有权转移</td>\n<td>from/to operator、承运信息、日期</td>\n<td>转移不改身份，只转移责任</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product（成品/SKU）</td>\n<td>上市或出口的商品</td>\n<td>CN 编码、GTIN、净质量</td>\n<td>见下游引用模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>边只有四类，且必须<strong>有向</strong>：<code>derived_from</code>（一个批次的物料来自另一个批次或地块）、<code>transformed_into</code>（转化事件的输入输出关系）、<code>shipped_as</code>（批次被打包成某次运输）、<code>declared_in</code>（批次或成品被某份 DDS 申报覆盖）。整张图是一个<strong>有向无环图（DAG）</strong>——如果出现环，说明数据里存在时间倒流的录入错误或伪造的闭环，应作为数据质量缺陷直接拦截。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  P1[地块 A&lt;br/&gt;印尼小农园] --&gt; B1[果串批次&lt;br/&gt;2026-03-12 收获]&#10;  P2[地块 B&lt;br/&gt;印尼小农园] --&gt; B1&#10;  B1 --&gt; T1[压榨转化&lt;br/&gt;毛棕榈油]&#10;  T1 --&gt; B2[毛油批次&lt;br/&gt;储罐混合]&#10;  B3[其他来源毛油批次] --&gt; B2&#10;  B2 --&gt; T2[精炼与分提&lt;br/&gt;RBD 棕榈油]&#10;  T2 --&gt; B4[精炼油批次]&#10;  B4 --&gt; T3[烘焙转化&lt;br/&gt;饼干成型]&#10;  T3 --&gt; B5[成品批次&lt;br/&gt;含 GTIN + SSCC]&#10;  B5 --&gt; S1[出口运输&lt;br/&gt;鹿特丹]&#10;  S1 --&gt; DDS[DDS 申报&lt;br/&gt;引用上游参考号]\">flowchart TD\n  P1[地块 A&lt;br/&gt;印尼小农园] --&gt; B1[果串批次&lt;br/&gt;2026-03-12 收获]\n  P2[地块 B&lt;br/&gt;印尼小农园] --&gt; B1\n  B1 --&gt; T1[压榨转化&lt;br/&gt;毛棕榈油]\n  T1 --&gt; B2[毛油批次&lt;br/&gt;储罐混合]\n  B3[其他来源毛油批次] --&gt; B2\n  B2 --&gt; T2[精炼与分提&lt;br/&gt;RBD 棕榈油]\n  T2 --&gt; B4[精炼油批次]\n  B4 --&gt; T3[烘焙转化&lt;br/&gt;饼干成型]\n  T3 --&gt; B5[成品批次&lt;br/&gt;含 GTIN + SSCC]\n  B5 --&gt; S1[出口运输&lt;br/&gt;鹿特丹]\n  S1 --&gt; DDS[DDS 申报&lt;br/&gt;引用上游参考号]</pre><h2 id=\"四种保管模式-身份保留-隔离-质量平衡与账面主张\">四种保管模式：身份保留、隔离、质量平衡与账面主张</h2><p>同一张 DAG 上，物料如何在节点间&quot;记账&quot;决定了可追溯性的成本与强度。ISO 22005 的追溯体系框架与 ISEAL 的监管链（Chain of Custody）模型把保管模式分为四档，EUDR 没有明文强制其中一种，但在<strong>风险评估（Art. 10）</strong> 时需要证据能支撑&quot;无毁林&quot;的结论，因此模式越弱，需要补充的证据越多：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>身份保留（Identity Preserved, IP）</strong>：地块身份全程不丢失，一批次对应单一来源。可追溯性最强，成本最高；适用于高价值小批量（如精品可可、单一庄园咖啡）。</li>\n<li><strong>隔离（Segregation）</strong>：允许同一设施处理多来源，但物理隔离，任一时刻一批次只含已认证来源。文件与实物分离管理。</li>\n<li><strong>质量平衡（Mass Balance）</strong>：允许物理混合，但按<strong>数量记账</strong>：进入系统的无毁林数量等于可以&quot;分配&quot;给产出的无毁林数量。小农混合场景事实上的主流模式。</li>\n<li><strong>账面主张（Book and Claim）</strong>：完全不要求物理关联，只交易&quot;信用额度&quot;。对 EUDR 而言风险最高，因为无法为具体商品出示地块级证据，通常不足以单独支撑 DDS。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对跨境电商经营者的现实含义：棕榈油、大豆、橡胶等散装商品的链条几乎不可能是 IP，实际落地点是<strong>质量平衡 + 地点级证据</strong>的组合——用质量平衡管理数量流，用上游 DDS 参考号与地块几何管理&quot;来源是否无毁林&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批次标识与载体-批号-gtin-sscc-与-epcis-事件\">批次标识与载体：批号、GTIN/SSCC 与 EPCIS 事件</h2><p>身份要在系统间移动，必须落到标准标识符上，否则每换一个系统就要重新对账。GS1 体系给了三层标识，恰好覆盖批次谱系的三类节点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标识类型</th>\n<th>GS1 名称</th>\n<th>标识对象</th>\n<th>在谱系图中的位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GTIN</td>\n<td>Global Trade Item Number</td>\n<td>商品品类/SKU</td>\n<td>Product 节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Batch/Lot 号</td>\n<td>AI (10)</td>\n<td>生产批次</td>\n<td>Batch 节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSCC</td>\n<td>Serial Shipping Container Code</td>\n<td>物流单元（托盘/箱）</td>\n<td>Shipment 节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GLN</td>\n<td>Global Location Number</td>\n<td>主体/设施</td>\n<td>Transformation 节点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把这三层串起来的事件模型是 <strong>EPCIS 2.0（ISO/IEC 19987）</strong>，它定义了四个核心事件类型——ObjectEvent（观察到什么）、AggregationEvent（装盘/装箱）、TransformationEvent（投入变成产出）、TransactionEvent（与业务单据关联）。EUDR 的谱系图与 EPCIS 的映射关系非常直接：<code>Transformation</code> 节点就是 TransformationEvent，<code>Shipment</code> 节点就是 AggregationEvent + TransactionEvent，<code>Batch</code> 的混合就是多个 input 指向同一 output 的 TransformationEvent。基于此，很多合规平台不再自造事件模型，而是把 EPCIS 作为<strong>上游采集层</strong>，再投影成面向 DDS 的谱系视图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"转化事件与数量守恒-收率核算与质量平衡分配\">转化事件与数量守恒：收率核算与质量平衡分配</h2><p>批次谱系最容易被忽视的约束是<strong>数量必须守恒</strong>。一个压榨转化事件把 100 吨果串变成 22 吨毛油和 78 吨副产物（壳、纤维、POME），收率</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = \\frac{\\sum_i q_{out,i}}{\\sum_j q_{in,j}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5615em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对棕榈果串通常落在 0.20–0.25 区间；如果数据里出现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（产出多于投入），要么是单位混用（吨 vs 千克），要么是录入错误，必须在谱系构建时作为缺陷拦截，否则会向上游要求超出实际供应的&quot;无毁林数量&quot;。</p>\n<p>质量平衡模式下，无毁林数量的分配是核心算法。设某批次总量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，其中无毁林来源量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{DF}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，系统总来源量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{total}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则分配给该批次的合规数量为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{DF} = q \\cdot \\frac{V_{DF}}{V_{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个比例必须<strong>在链上逐级传递并累计</strong>：从储罐到精炼油，每一跳都要重新按当跳的投入比例摊销，而不是只在最后一步计算。工程实践里，这条链的累计误差是审计中最常被抽查的项，因此需要保留每一步的分配依据（当跳的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{DF}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{total}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 快照），而不能只存最终结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dds-参考号-让跨主体的批次引用获得法律效力\">DDS 参考号：让跨主体的批次引用获得法律效力</h2><p>批次谱系在企业内部的图是私有的，但链条一跨出企业边界就断了。EUDR 用<strong>尽职调查申报（DDS）参考号</strong>把私有图缝成公开可核验的链。法规 (EU) 2023/1115 第 4 条与第 33 条要求：经营者首次将相关商品投放市场或出口时，须在欧盟信息系统（EUDR Information System，2024 年 12 月 4 日上线）提交 DDS，系统返回一个唯一参考号；<strong>下游经营者与贸易商</strong>引用该参考号，即完成对上游尽职调查的核验，无需重复做全套评估。</p>\n<p>这条机制对数据模型的直接后果是：Batch 与 Product 节点上必须携带 <code>upstream_dds_ref</code> 字段，且该字段在谱系图中是一条真正跨组织的边。工程上要处理三个易错点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>参考号与批次的粒度错配</strong>：一份 DDS 可能覆盖多个批次、多个地块，也可能只覆盖一批。谱系图必须允许 <code>declared_in</code> 是一对多关系，不能假设一份 DDS 对应一个批次。</li>\n<li><strong>参考号的时效与作废</strong>：上游 DDS 可能因风险评估结果变化而被修订或撤销；下游需有机制感知失效，而不是把参考号当作永久有效的凭证。</li>\n<li><strong>验证层级</strong>：按欧委会的简化安排，上游经营者承担完整尽职调查，下游与贸易商义务&quot;更轻&quot;，微型与小型初级经营者适用更简规则——这意味着谱系图在不同规模主体间的<strong>证据密度本就不同</strong>，建模时要为&quot;简化声明&quot;预留与完整 DDS 不同的字段集，而非强行套用同一 schema。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"谱系闭合与追溯查询-递归-cte-与聚合丢失点\">谱系闭合与追溯查询：递归 CTE 与聚合丢失点</h2><p>批次的祖先链深度常常超过十跳，查询必须用<strong>递归 CTE</strong> 而非固定层数的 JOIN。以下片段从一个成品批次反向追溯到所有地块：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH RECURSIVE lineage AS (&#10;  SELECT batch_id, source_id, source_type&#10;  FROM batch_inputs&#10;  WHERE batch_id = :finished_batch&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT bi.batch_id, bi.source_id, bi.source_type&#10;  FROM batch_inputs bi&#10;  JOIN lineage l ON bi.batch_id = l.source_id&#10;  WHERE l.source_type = &#39;batch&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT source_id AS plot_id&#10;FROM lineage&#10;WHERE source_type = &#39;plot&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RECURSIVE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lineage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_id, source_id, source_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_inputs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :finished_batch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_inputs bi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lineage l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'batch'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plot_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lineage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'plot'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里有一个不可回避的<strong>聚合丢失点（lossy aggregation）</strong>：当多个地块的物料在某一跳被混合时，下游批次无法再逆向确定某一件成品&quot;具体来自哪一块地&quot;，只能确定它来自那<strong>一组</strong>地块。这不是实现缺陷，而是物理事实。合规上正确的表述是&quot;该成品批次的可追溯地块集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 中所有地块均在 2020-12-31 基线后无毁林&quot;——把单点确定性问题转化为集合一致性问题。任何声称能给出单一来源地块的实现，要么链条从未混合（IP 模式），要么在数据层做了不可靠的推断。</p>\n<p>因此谱系模型的设计目标不是&quot;追到唯一地块&quot;，而是：正向能回答&quot;这批地块流向了哪些成品&quot;，反向能回答&quot;这件成品关联了哪些地块&quot;，并在每一跳保留数量与分配依据，供 Art. 10 的风险评估与监管抽查复算。前向与后向两种查询必须共用同一张边表，否则两条路径会因数据源不同而对不上账——这是审计中最致命的矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>地块谱系建模的本质，是把法规落在&quot;地块&quot;上的义务，通过一张有向无环图传递到最终商品上：五类节点（地块、批次、转化、运输、成品）承载身份，四类有向边（派生、转化、装运、申报）承载关系，四种保管模式（身份保留、隔离、质量平衡、账面主张）决定身份在混合中的存活强度。工程上的三个硬约束——数量守恒的收率核算、逐跳摊销的质量平衡分配、以及共用边表的前后向一致查询——共同决定了这张图能否在监管抽查时被复算。跨主体的那一段则由 DDS 参考号缝合，因此模型必须容忍参考号与批次的粒度错配、上游申报的失效，以及不同规模主体间本就不同的证据密度。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"地块溯源与批次谱系建模：从原料到成品的供应链图谱","id":"地块溯源与批次谱系建模-从原料到成品的供应链图谱"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：谱系图的五类节点与四类边","id":"核心概念-谱系图的五类节点与四类边"},{"level":2,"text":"四种保管模式：身份保留、隔离、质量平衡与账面主张","id":"四种保管模式-身份保留-隔离-质量平衡与账面主张"},{"level":2,"text":"批次标识与载体：批号、GTIN/SSCC 与 EPCIS 事件","id":"批次标识与载体-批号-gtin-sscc-与-epcis-事件"},{"level":2,"text":"转化事件与数量守恒：收率核算与质量平衡分配","id":"转化事件与数量守恒-收率核算与质量平衡分配"},{"level":2,"text":"DDS 参考号：让跨主体的批次引用获得法律效力","id":"dds-参考号-让跨主体的批次引用获得法律效力"},{"level":2,"text":"谱系闭合与追溯查询：递归 CTE 与聚合丢失点","id":"谱系闭合与追溯查询-递归-cte-与聚合丢失点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"地块地理定位数据模型：坐标精度、多边形与 GeoJSON 规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eudr-deforestation-free-supply-chain-due-diligence/parcel-geolocation-traceability-data/parcel-geolocation-data-model"},"next":{"title":"卫星影像比对与毁林变化监测数据管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eudr-deforestation-free-supply-chain-due-diligence/parcel-geolocation-traceability-data/satellite-imagery-deforestation-verification"}}